## Development

See [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for the rules, the skills (procedures) and the documentation index.


### Prerequisites

- [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) ≥ 0.5{% if python == 'none' %} (runs the template tooling: copier{% if releases %}, git-cliff{% endif %}){% endif %}
- [just](https://just.systems/) (task runner)
{%- if platform == 'github' %}
- [GitHub CLI](https://cli.github.com/) ≥ 2.105 (issues{% if releases %}, PRs, releases{% else %} and PRs{% endif %} through `just`)
{%- else %}
- [forgejo-cli](https://codeberg.org/forgejo-contrib/forgejo-cli) (`fj`) 0.7 (issues{% if releases %}, PRs, releases{% else %} and PRs{% endif %} through `just`)
{%- endif %}
{%- if python != 'none' %}
- Python {{ python_version }} (managed by uv via `.python-version`)
{%- endif %}

`.copier/setup.sh` installs all of these on a clean Linux machine; `just doctor` checks an existing setup.

### Common commands

| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
{%- if python != 'none' %}
| `just fix` | Auto-format and fix imports (run before committing) |
| `just lint` | Ruff + pyright only (fast feedback, no tests) |
| `just check` | Full CI suite: format-check + lint + typecheck + tests |
{%- else %}
| `just check` | Everything that must pass before a PR |
{%- endif %}
| `just --list` | Show all available recipes |


Issues{% if releases %}, PRs and releases{% else %} and PRs{% endif %} are also handled through `just` recipes (`just issues`, `just pr`{% if releases %}, `just release`{% endif %}, …) — see [docs/workflow.md](docs/workflow.md).
